  "guide.tempad.page.4.body": "Attach a filled Location Card to the portable Projector with a right click in your inventory. Use it to open a timedoor, or sneak-use to place it. A placed Projector opens on a redstone pulse. It can be charged from a battery or adjacent Metronome; empty-hand use removes the card and sneak-use picks up the device.",
