  "guide.tempad.page.0.title": "The Tempad",
  "guide.tempad.page.0.body": "Open the Tempad to browse saved locations. Select one to open a timedoor. The device needs chronons or the configured fuel and a usable destination.",
  "guide.tempad.page.1.title": "Saved locations",
  "guide.tempad.page.1.body": "Save your current position with the plus button. Mark a location as favorite for quick access and for a Workstation portal. Export a location to a card to share it.",
  "guide.tempad.page.2.title": "Chronons",
  "guide.tempad.page.2.body": "Charge a Tempad from a Chronon Battery or a Metronome. A Metronome also charges a nearby Workstation owned by the same player. Redstone activates the Workstation's portal to your favorite location.",
  "guide.tempad.page.3.title": "Upgrades",
  "guide.tempad.page.3.body": "Insert a Tempad into a Workstation, then use an upgrade item on it. Wait for the download to finish before removing the device. Installed upgrades stay on the Tempad when you pick it up.",
